    "# Topic Relevance & Corporate Disclosure: Pre-Processing, Dual-Instrument Design, and Panel Construction\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a complete technical guide to the **Topic Relevance and Corporate Disclosure Pipeline** ([`T3 - Topic Relevance and Corporate Disclosure`](.)), detailing the dual-instrument identification strategy, SEC Form 10-K Item 1 sentence segmentation, cross-firm boilerplate filtering, dense vector centroid scoring, 2-pass index-cited LLM tagging, gold-standard gate auditing, and longitudinal firm panel assembly.\n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. End-to-End Workflow & Output Flowchart\n",
    "\n",
    "### Pipeline Flowchart\n",
    "\n",
    "```mermaid\n",
    "flowchart TD\n",
    "    subgraph S1 [\"Step 1: 10-K Ingestion & Text Normalization\"]\n",
    "        A[\"SEC Form 10-K Filings<br/>(21,966 Item 1 Sections, 1993–2025)\"] --> B[\"pysbd v0.3.4 Segmentation<br/>(relevance.segment_item1)\"]\n",
    "        B --> C[\"Length Gate (>= 30 chars)<br/>Drop table headers & fragments\"]\n",
    "    end\n",
    "\n",
    "    subgraph S2 [\"Step 2: Cross-Firm Boilerplate Filtering\"]\n",
    "        C --> D[\"Canonical Normalization & Hashing<br/>(normalize_for_dedup & dedup_key)\"]\n",
    "        D --> E[\"Filter template text appearing in >= 20 distinct firms\"]\n",
    "        E --> F[\"Cleaned 10-K Business Sentence Stream<br/>(~14.8M indexed sentences)\"]\n",
    "    end\n",
    "\n",
    "    subgraph S3 [\"Step 3: Dual-Instrument Measurement Rails\"]\n",
    "        F --> G1[\"Layer 1: Deterministic Embedding Rail<br/>(BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5, CLS pooled)\"]\n",
    "        G1 --> H1[\"Cosine Distance to 111 Topic Centroids<br/>(Zero generation inference)\"]\n",
    "        \n",
    "        F --> G2[\"Layer 2: 2-Pass Index-Cited LLM Tagging<br/>(Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B in 40-sentence blocks)\"]\n",
    "        G2 --> H2a[\"Pass A (Gate): Scan 111 Topic Labels<br/>(GATE_USER -> Candidate Topic IDs)\"]\n",
    "        H2a --> H2b[\"Pass B (Confirm): Verify Candidate Topics<br/>(CONFIRM_USER -> Compact Triples: [sent_id, topic_id, O|T|N])\"]\n",
    "    end\n",
    "\n",
    "    subgraph S4 [\"Step 4: Panel Assembly & Compustat Linkage\"]\n",
    "        H1 --> I[\"Merge Layer 1 Distances + Layer 2 Tags\"]\n",
    "        H2b --> I\n",
    "        I --> J[\"Map CIK to Compustat GVKEY (CRSP link)<br/>Aggregate disclosure intensity by (firm, year, topic)\"]\n",
    "        J --> K[\"firm_topic_relevance_panel.parquet<br/>(Master longitudinal corporate disclosure panel)\"]\n",
    "    end\n",
    "\n",
    "    subgraph S5 [\"Step 5: Quality Assessment & Dual-Instrument Audit\"]\n",
    "        K --> L[\"Gold Standard Gate Audit (T3.3.1)<br/>Precision 93.4%, Recall 91.2%, F1 0.923\"]\n",
    "        L --> M[\"Dual-Instrument Agreement & Figures (T3.3.2)<br/>Cross-rail concordance & industry heatmaps\"]\n",
    "    end\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Pipeline Stages and Output Matrix\n",
    "\n",
    "| Stage | Module / Script | Primary Operations | Input Data | Generated Output Artifact & Type |\n",
    "|---|---|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **1. Text Extraction & Segmentation** | `item1_local.py` & `relevance.py` | Extracts Item 1 Business Description from SEC EDGAR 10-K filings; segments sentences via `pysbd`. | Raw Form 10-Ks (21,966 filings) | **Raw Sentence Table** (`list[dict]`: `cik`, `fyear`, `sent_idx`, `text`) |\n",
    "| **2. Boilerplate Filtering** | `relevance.py` (`dedup_key`) | Collapses digits/whitespace into canonical hashes; filters boilerplate appearing in $\ge 20$ firms. | Raw Sentence Table | **Cleaned Business Sentences** (`cleaned_sentences.parquet`, ~14.8M rows) |\n",
    "| **3. Layer 1 Embedding Rail** | `relevance.py` (`encode`) | Generates L2-normalized float16 embeddings (`bge-large-en-v1.5`); computes dot-product cosine distances to 111 topic centroids. | Cleaned Business Sentences + Topic Centroids | **Embedding Distance Matrix** (`interim/centroid_distances.parquet`, ~11 GB) |\n",
    "| **4. Layer 2 Pass A (Gate)** | `tagging.py` (`GATE_USER`) | LLM scans 111 topic labels in 40-sentence blocks $\to$ selects plausible candidate topic IDs (max 160 new tokens). | 40-Sentence Blocks + 111 Topic Labels | **Candidate Topic ID Lists** (`list[int]`) |\n",
    "| **5. Layer 2 Pass B (Confirm)** | `tagging.py` (`CONFIRM_USER`) | LLM reads candidate topics with full definitions $\to$ outputs compact index-cited triples `[sent, topic, O|T|N]` (max 512 tokens). | Sentence Blocks + Candidate Definitions | **Tagged Disclosure Records** (`interim/relevance_tags/`) |\n",
    "| **6. Panel Merging & CRSP Link** | `T3.2.2` | Maps CIK $\\to$ GVKEY via CRSP-Compustat tables; aggregates tagged sentences by `(firm, fyear, topic)`. | Tagged Records + Embedding Scores + Compustat | **`firm_topic_relevance_panel.parquet`** (`cleaned/03_topic_relevance/`) |\n",
    "| **7. Quality Audit & Validation** | `T3.3.1` & `T3.3.2` | Benchmarks against hand-annotated gold evaluation set; evaluates Layer 1 vs Layer 2 concordance. | Final Panel + Gold Sample | **`gold_audit_metrics.parquet`** + **`industry_topic_heatmaps.pdf`** |"
   ]
